P05.text:
{시작}

Medium shot from a low angle in front of him: he stands bare-chested with both arms spread wide out to the sides, hands half open, his head tilted back so his face looks up into the light — seen from below we see his jaw, chin, the underside of his nose and his closed eyes. His body fills the lower middle of the frame (head near the upper third), arms reaching to both edges. Behind and above him a hazy cobalt light pours down.

{배치}

{태준_얼굴}

{태준_머리}

{태준_몸}

EXPRESSION: eyes closed, face calm and open to the light, lips closed, no smile.

{빛}

EXPOSURE: a bright, airy frame — the hazy light pouring down makes most of the frame a luminous medium-to-light cobalt blue, his upper body brightly rim-lit.

{마감}

P12.text:
{시작}

Medium close-up from a slightly low camera: his body is turned three-quarters toward frame right. POSITION (exact numbers — the layout's black head shape includes long hair, his real head is smaller): he stands on the LEFT half of the frame; the top of his head is cut by the top edge, his eyes at 16% of the frame height, mouth at 28%, chin at 37%, shoulder line at 50%; his face is about 13% of the frame width, centred at about 41% of the width. Only his raised left hand with the green block reaches into the right side, at about 72–80% of the width and 42–68% of the height. The right third of the frame is mostly empty blue background. His LEFT hand (the arm on the frame-right side) is held out beside his neck at shoulder height, a little away from his body toward frame right, holding a small bright green rectangular block (a stand-in object) tilted exactly like the green block in the layout (its top leaning toward frame right), as if he is about to spray it onto the left side of his neck; his right arm hangs relaxed at the lower left. His chin is slightly raised and his face is in three-quarter view turned toward frame right (we see more of his right cheek), eyes looking off past frame right. The green block must stay a solid flat chroma green (#00B140) with sharp straight edges and no texture, reflections or print — it will be replaced later. His fingers wrap naturally around it.

{배치}

{태준_얼굴}

{태준_머리}

{태준_몸}

{표정}

{빛}

EXPOSURE: a medium-key frame with an overall mid-grey of about 50 — the background is a readable saturated cobalt (RGB around 15/50/110) everywhere, nothing crushed to black; his skin in cool soft light.

{마감}

P16.text:
{시작}

Close-up portrait: his head and bare shoulders, his face turned straight toward the camera, eyes looking just past the lens to frame left. SIZE AND POSITION (exact numbers — the layout's black head shape includes long hair, his real head is smaller; the face must NOT be larger than this): eyes at 23% of the frame height, mouth at 41%, chin at 56%, shoulder line at 70%; the face is about 21% of the frame width, centred at about 47% of the width; the top of his short hair may just touch the top edge. A cold rim light from the frame right outlines his cheekbone, jaw and ear; the rest of the face is in soft deep-blue shadow but clearly readable. An even deep navy background — the haze at the right is barely there (the right half at most 20% brighter than the left); overall a dark frame with a mid-grey of about 25.

{배치}

{태준_얼굴}

{태준_머리}

{태준_몸}

{표정}

{빛}

EXPOSURE: a low-key, moody close-up — mostly deep navy, only the rim light and the cheekbone catch the light.

{마감}
